    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "•Coonan Property present this spacious three-bedroom home, with a south-facing rear garden, in the highly sought-after Moyglare Hall development\n•Extending to approximately 106 sq.m, the well-proportioned accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, guest W.C., kitchen/dining room, living room, three bedrooms including a master ensuite, and a family bathroom\n•Presented in excellent condition throughout, the property features a spacious open-plan kitchen/dining area, generously sized bedrooms, and contemporary kitchen and bathroom finishes\n•Ideally positioned in a quiet cul-de-sac within the popular Moyglare Hall development, just a short stroll from Maynooth GAA and a selection of primary and secondary schools\n•Maynooth town centre is within easy walking distance, offering an excellent range of amenities including shops, cafés, restaurants and the Maynooth University campus\n•Excellent transport connections include Maynooth Train Station with direct services to Dublin city centre, regular Dublin Bus routes and convenient access to the M4 motorway\n•An ideal choice for first-time buyers seeking a stylish, move-in-ready home in a superb and convenient location\n\nGuide Price\n475,000\n\nType of Transaction\nPrivate Treaty\n\nAccommodation:\n\nEntrance Driveway\nCommunal parking with space for two cars. \n\nEntrance Hallway 6.10m x 1.77m\nSolid walnut floors extend through the hallway, with understairs storage complete with a door and smart pull-out drawers, coving and light fitting, and a composite front door to the entrance.\n\nGuest W.C. 1.44m x 1.42m\nTiled floor with tile splashback, w.c., w.h.b., extractor fan and window with Venetian blind.\n\nKitchen/Dining 5.50m x 5.66m\nCeramic tiled floor throughout, with fitted floor and wall kitchen units, tile splashback and stainless-steel sink. Appliances included in the sale include a double oven, gas hob, fitted dishwasher and extractor fan, complete with two ceiling light fittings and a hanging pendant light with shade. A door leads from the kitchen to the garden, with double French doors from the dining area also opening onto the garden, and double doors connecting through to the living room.\n\nLiving Room 5.10m x 3.68m\nLaminate floor with coving and light fitting, complete with curtains and roller blinds. Feature fireplace with gas fire insert, with double doors leading back to the kitchen and dining area.\n\nLanding 2.45m x 2.90m\nCarpeted, attic access and a fully shelved hot-press.\n\nMaster Bedroom 3.48m x 3.50m\nCarpet, fitted wardrobes, Venetian blinds and curtains, complete with TV point. Overlooks the rear garden, with ensuite off.\n\nEnsuite 2.10m x 1.37m\nFully tiled, with w.c., w.h.b. with built-in vanity and fitted mirror and shower cubicle. Light fitting, extractor fan, window with frosted glass and Venetian blind, complete with heated chrome towel rail.\n\nBedroom 2 3.12m x 4.28m\nCarpet with fitted wardrobes, roller blinds and curtains, complete with hanging pendant light with shade. A double room overlooking the front of the property.\n\nBedroom 3 3.30m x 2.41m\nFitted wardrobes, carpet, roller blind, curtains and a hanging pendant light with shade complete this third bedroom.\n\nBathroom 2.04m x 2.00m\nFully tiled with bath and shower screen, w.c., w.h.b. with built-in toiletries cabinet and fitted mirror. Hardwood double glazed window with Venetian blind, extractor fan and light fitting.\n\nGarden\nLaid out with a lawn, timber deck and patio area, complete with a timber shed and gated side entrance. With outside tap, outside light and security light. \n\nAdditional Information\nTwo parking spaces to the front \nGross internal floor area approx. 106 sq.m\nBuilt in 2007\nDouble glazed windows\nTriple glazing to the front\n\nItems Included in sale:\nDouble oven, gas hob, fitted dishwasher, extractor fan, curtains, blinds and light fittings. \n\nServices\nMains water\nGas fired central heating \n\nBER \nC1\n\nViewing\nBy appointment only.\n\nEircode: W23 H7D1\n\nContact Information\nSales Person \nMick Wright \n016286128\n\n\n \n"
      },
